# Spotlight — example environment configuration.
#
# Copy to `.env` (which is git-ignored) and fill in what you need. Every
# variable is OPTIONAL: with none set, Spotlight runs fully offline against the
# deterministic MockModelClient and a local subprocess sandbox — enough to try
# the whole pipeline end to end. Wire up the sections below to move to real
# LLM inference and an isolated sandbox.

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# LLM provider  (see spotlight/agents/moonshot.py)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Spotlight's agents reach a model only through the ModelClient protocol, and
# the shipped real-inference adapter speaks the OpenAI /chat/completions format
# — so ANY OpenAI-compatible endpoint works. Set an API key here and the
# Orchestrator picks it up automatically; leave them all unset to use the mock.
#
# Recommended, provider-neutral path:
#   SPOTLIGHT_LLM_API_KEY=sk-...
#   SPOTLIGHT_LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1   # default
#   SPOTLIGHT_LLM_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini                    # default
#
# Examples (uncomment one):
#
#   # OpenAI
#   SPOTLIGHT_LLM_API_KEY=sk-...
#   SPOTLIGHT_LLM_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
#
#   # Groq
#   SPOTLIGHT_LLM_API_KEY=gsk_...
#   SPOTLIGHT_LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.groq.com/openai/v1
#   SPOTLIGHT_LLM_MODEL=llama-3.3-70b-versatile
#
#   # Local Ollama (no cloud key — the key can be any non-empty string)
#   SPOTLIGHT_LLM_API_KEY=ollama
#   SPOTLIGHT_LLM_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434/v1
#   SPOTLIGHT_LLM_MODEL=llama3.1
#
#   # Local vLLM
#   SPOTLIGHT_LLM_API_KEY=vllm
#   SPOTLIGHT_LLM_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000/v1
#   SPOTLIGHT_LLM_MODEL=<your-served-model-name>
#
# Also supported for convenience (lower priority than SPOTLIGHT_LLM_*):
#   MOONSHOT_API_KEY=...        # Moonshot (Kimi) preset
#   OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...       # plain OpenAI

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Sandbox  (see spotlight/sandbox/router.py)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Reproductions run in an isolated Modal container with network egress denied.
# Without Modal credentials, Spotlight falls back to a local subprocess sandbox
# (fine for local dev; NOT isolated — do not point it at untrusted code on a
# shared host).
#   SPOTLIGHT_SANDBOX=auto        # auto | modal | subprocess   (default: auto)
#   MODAL_TOKEN_ID=...
#   MODAL_TOKEN_SECRET=...

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# API server  (see spotlight/api/)  — only needed if you run the FastAPI backend
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#   SPOTLIGHT_AUTH_MODE=auto              # auto | required | disabled
#   SPOTLIGHT_API_KEY=...                 # required when auth is on
#   SPOTLIGHT_CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173
#   DATABASE_URL=postgresql://...         # omit to use the local SQLite dev DB
#   SPOTLIGHT_LOG_LEVEL=info

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Signing  (see spotlight/non_repudiation/)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Ed25519 private key used to sign the attestation chain of custody. If unset,
# an ephemeral key is generated per process — fine for local runs, but those
# signatures won't verify after a restart. Set a persistent key in production.
#   SPOTLIGHT_SIGNING_KEY=...
